PTX MP+fence.release.sync_restrict+two-stores
"P0 stores x and then z to its CTA's shared memory, then fence.release.sync_restrict::shared::cta.cluster and a relaxed store of the flag f; P1, in the same CTA, acquires f and reads x. The restricted release fence orders every earlier operation on the CTA's shared memory, not only the last one (9.7.13.4): reading f == 1 and x == 0 is forbidden."
{
x=0;
z=0;
f=0;
P1:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                         | P1@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0              ;
 st.weak.shared::cta x, 1                         | ld.acquire.cluster.shared::cta r0, f  ;
 st.weak.shared::cta z, 1                         | ld.weak.shared::cta r1, x             ;
 fence.release.sync_restrict::shared::cta.cluster |                                       ;
 st.relaxed.cluster.shared::cta f, 1              |                                       ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
